Q: How to replicate this mpv socat command but as a PHP 8.2 cURL request? A: <p>this worked for me perfect on php v8.4.24<br />
important is the linefeed or PHP_EOL on the command end:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;?php
$socketFile = 'unix:///tmp/mpvsocket';

// Verbindung zum Socket herstellen
$socket = stream_socket_client($socketFile, $errno, $errstr, 2);

if (!$socket) {
    die(&quot;Fehler bei Verbindung: $errstr ($errno)&quot;);
}

// JSON-Befehl definieren (z. B. Pause umschalten / Toggle Pause)
$command = json_encode([
    &quot;command&quot; =&gt; [&quot;cycle&quot;, &quot;pause&quot;]
]) . &quot;\n&quot;;

// Befehl senden
fwrite($socket, $command);

// Antwort lesen
$response = fread($socket, 2048);
echo &quot;Antwort von mpv: &quot; . $response;

// Verbindung schließen
fclose($socket);
?&gt;
</code></pre>
